;    1: TDecorate(count=70, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=121, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=わな, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=わな, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ひん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=すいがんじゅさつ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=930, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=849, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―Time passed after that, and I would come to learn more about this settlement, about Droga, and about the events of the past.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Better not to use Droga?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes. I can't shake the feeling that that drug is some kind of </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="わな">trap</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE><PG>
That was what I advised <STYLE ID="1">Ko-san</STYLE>, who had been minding the child in my place.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
5 years had passed since I came to the Arata settlement, and <STYLE ID="1">Ko-san</STYLE>, too, had begun going out to hunt using Droga.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"A </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="わな">trap</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">? What do you mean?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　It's only a drug made from the roots of cherry trees―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's certainly so. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But... from what I've found so far, it has been more than 400 years since Droga appeared. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">And during those 400 years, in this settlement, strange events..."</STYLE><PG>
I had been investigating not only Droga but also the events that had taken place in this settlement until then.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the past, it seemed, this settlement had come to the <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ひん">brink</STYLE> of destruction several times.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This settlement hides secrets that even its residents do not yet know.<PG>
Time is a heartless thing. There must have been some warning in those days, but it gradually becomes an empty formality and is lost from people's memory.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though there was a warning for escaping that crisis, as time passes it sinks into mere lore and myth.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Among all this, there was one thing that especially caught my attention.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\翠眼呪殺.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It was the phenomenon known as '<STYLE ID="6" RUBY="すいがんじゅさつ">Green-Eye Curse-Killing</STYLE>.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This too was written in the storehouse books, of course. In this settlement, every so often, a child is born with green eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that book,
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
'A green-eyed boy shall be raised as he is. A green-eyed girl shall be killed at once.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
is written, or words to that effect.<PG>
The only child born since I came to this settlement was my child with <STYLE ID="1">Ko-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I did not know whether a child connected with that 'Green-Eye Curse-Killing' had ever really been born.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But even if I wanted to confirm it, asking <STYLE ID="1">Ko-san</STYLE>, 'Do you kill green-eyed girls?' made me a little uneasy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I could not even tell whether it had anything to do with Droga.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Uh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Do you know of the Green-Eye Curse-Killing?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ko-san</STYLE>, who had been sitting in a chair holding the child, stopped moving.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From this reaction of Ko-san's, I could tell how he had taken my words.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------